    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a gallery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find an anomaly, turn back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't, keep going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to escape from this endless corridor by solving the mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Control </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W A S D + Mouse: Move &amp; Look  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >M:Open Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Features </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb3D HD Graphics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFirst Person Puzzle Solving Adventure  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSingle Ending </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Video Distribution Guidelines </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPosting and streaming videos are allowed without permission whether you are an individual or a corporation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMonetization only allowed using the features provided by video distribution platforms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPlease include the game's name in the title of your video or stream and add a link to the Steam page in the description. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWe do not take any responsibilities for any issues occurred by you posting videos or streaming this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe contents of these guidelines may change without notice.</p>",
